<title>UK: Storehouse up as SBC Warburg repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Storehouse up as SBC Warburg repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in retail group Storehouse Plc rose on Monday as analysts at SBC Warburg repeated a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation on the stock, market sources said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 5p at by 1120 GMT in thin volume of 148,206 shares.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
